    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1: Load knowledge base\nFor NEW or UPDATED files only.\nThe 2026 offer PDF is already loaded (notebook, 43 records).\nUploading the same PDF again creates duplicates.",
        "height": 200,
